  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>LOCA</b>

    DCA Section: 15.6.5. Initiates a pipe break of the CVC
    system inside containment. Reactor Coolant System (RCS) depressurizes and coolant
    enters containment. Containment will isolate. ECCS will actuate when CNT level
    rises significantly.


    <b>CVC Charging line</b>

    A pipe break in the
    CVC Charging line


    <b>Small</b>

    A small break resulting in 0.1-5% of
    the flow escaping. Typically causes one or more cautions and eventually an alarm,
    but not a safety system actuation.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d84390f87e632e14e9a6fa65577f5ca4, type: 2}
